subleaf.text:
Client code should query subleaf IDs until reaching the first invalid subleaf,
@pconfig_subleaf_type = 0. A specific subleaf type can appear multiple times and
need not to be consecutive.

Subleaves' EBX, ECX, and EDX bitfield layout depends on the subleaf type. Since only
one subleaf type is supported so far, the E[BCD]X bitfields layout below assumes a
@pconfig_subleaf_type = 1 (PCONFIG Target Identifier).
